{"title":"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/008a9e810af5fdb5ab5ec8f217d0d0628e148d79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" /> is written out, it has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28time_consuming.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(time_consuming)\">Solution 1 (time consuming)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (time consuming)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Writing out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/6/7c60e8eac9a46e4be2a68f1f0178a310f5081c68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300^8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae4db9c161f369d6012b3863755b1b9d4000834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300^{8} = 65~610~000~000~000~000~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"276\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Counting all of the digits here, we see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/4342b92ba99a40c49a7b6219cd0e49401dd232ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\boxed{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"25\" /> digits.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28easier_to_see.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(easier_to_see)\">Solution 2 (easier to see)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (easier to see)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we can realize that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/b/40b005ce9a36c1a5d965b1ed9b27f62b2b0fb3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300^{8} = (3 \\times 10 \\times 10)^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"172\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03e21f2716135f5c94b2fa86748da8cd13b10e6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 3^{8} \\times 10^{8} \\times 10^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5fcb5826aca60b9fea08fc56f95c5b990e2dcd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=3^{8} \\times 10^{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/3207b6b7976a3004c227e54629c3c38bc7fa213a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{8} = 6561$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />, which has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4cea7bd1fc661281c9f5422dc378614cd26ab567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"17\" /> adds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more digits because multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> adds one more digit to a number.\n</p><p>Thus, in total, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/48260b896f24ae235b71ff0837cf32a25ac1b0a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 4 + 16 = \\boxed{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"139\" height=\"25\" /> digits.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC\">2017 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_C\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem C\">Relay 1 Problem C</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title